r">AI Image Generator</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/generator/ai-photo-editor">AI Photo Editor</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-black/40 dark:text-white/40 tracking-[0.06em] uppercase mb-4">Benchmarks</h3><ul class="space-y-3"><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks">All Benchmarks</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/gpqa">GPQA</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/mmlu">MMLU</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/mmlu-pro">MMLU-Pro</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/aime-2025">AIME 2025</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/math">MATH</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/humaneval">HumanEval</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/mmmu">MMMU</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white inline-block" href="/benchmarks/livecodebench">LiveCodeBench</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 transition-col